Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:34:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Separate composer additions from team room administration

Use the native add menu pattern and compact member dialog; move room settings and tasks out of the transcript into explicit header actions. Disclose unsupported group attachments rather than imply delivery. Preserve membership saves and no-replay behavior, verified by 28 tests and typecheck.
